# Chad Vantage's rental scooters (data/vehicles.json types.scooter, game/vehicles.ts; physics phase 31):
# twelve parked on Market, in threes at four docks. Beside the first, on UN Plaza's piece of Market, F (use)
# gets on: vehicleEnter with its type (the client chirps, the display says ride started). Up: the motor,
# slow (4.7 m/s, 17 km/h, after 5.5 s). Down brakes to a stop; F gets off on the board beside it, and the
# ride ends: 7.7 s, $1.49 (a dollar to unlock, 49 cents for the minute started): scooterRideEnd's fare.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 358.9 323.7 -1.08 45
tap use 30
hold up 40..700
hold down 720..900
tap use 950
run 1100
expect event vehicleEnter{name=vantage_1,type=scooter} within 30..32
expect state drive at 500
expect van.hspeed > 4.5 at 700
expect van.hspeed < 5.6 at 700
expect van.hspeed < 0.3 at 900
expect event vehicleExit{name=vantage_1,type=scooter} within 950..952
expect event scooterRideEnd{fare=149} within 950..952
expect state ground at 1000
expect no event scooterBattery
expect no event bail
